          "checked_at": "2026-10-18",
          "excerpt": "Kash Patel became the ninth Director of the FBI on February 20, 2025. He graduated from the University of Richmond in 2002 with a bachelor's degree in criminal justice and history; earned his juris doctor; began his career in 2005 as a public defender in Florida. In 2014 he began his DOJ tenure as a national security prosecutor. In 2020 he became DoD chief of staff.",
